# {{BRAND_TITLE}} — login-ui (skeleton)

Base-absent **skeleton fallback** for the mesh repo-templating pilot. When the
Tier-2 base (`snapdragon-login-ui`) is not pullable, `render_repo_tree()` renders
THIS minimal, bootable tree instead of refusing.

* Zero dependencies — `npm ci && npm run build` runs fully **OFFLINE** and emits a
  static, titled bundle under `dist/`.
* When the base is reachable, the full Angular native-federation remote is built
  instead and this skeleton is not used.

```
npm ci
npm run build      # -> dist/index.html  (titled "{{BRAND_TITLE}}")
```
